{"ID":"20250815141326-vo9owdq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250815141326-vo9owdq","title":"UPL2-3——GPU Usage 模块","type":"doc","updated":"20250815150528"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815143754-f414nkp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250815143754-f414nkp","updated":"20250815144253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250815143755-7etoq7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143755-7etoq7y","updated":"20250815144253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章内容涉及图形接口知识，相关内容可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240510153353-dvclowz","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US1L7——必备的图形程序接口概念"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n本章还涉及一些 Shader 相关概念，具体可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240321152521-nkhbjzt","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US——Unity Shader开发入门"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141326-cmh2cig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250815141326-cmh2cig","updated":"20250815150528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Usage 模块"}]},{"ID":"20250815141747-jnq5muw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141747-jnq5muw","updated":"20250815141753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Usage（使用率）是 Unity Profiler 中最重要的性能分析模块之一，用于 分析 GPU（图形处理器）在一帧中在哪些渲染阶段上花了多少时间"}]},{"ID":"20250815141800-5kmbswq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141800-5kmbswq","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏开发中会造成GPU开销的主要有："}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-gvyi76o","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-gvyi76o","updated":"20250815141810"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-wd92vpx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-wd92vpx","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-e523y2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-e523y2q","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"几何处理：模型顶点相关处理"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-l29jbxy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-l29jbxy","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-i1sl09u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-i1sl09u","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照计算：阴影、反射等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-d0s5n5w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-d0s5n5w","updated":"20250815141810"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-svrc634","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-svrc634","updated":"20250815141810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渲染输出：Shader 处理、对象渲染、游戏画面显示"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-nj48eeg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-nj48eeg","updated":"20250815141809"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-y6bdlqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-y6bdlqt","updated":"20250815141809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屏幕后处理 Shader 部分：屏幕画面特殊效果（模糊、黑白、景深等等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-eojxwcj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-eojxwcj","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-fviqv06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-fviqv06","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理处理：采样、解压缩、贴图操作等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141806-wkk94vw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-wkk94vw","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141806-iqj0xia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141806-iqj0xia","updated":"20250815141806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特效处理：粒子、流体、烟雾等等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141803-k1769el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141803-k1769el","updated":"20250815141803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250815141802-0tjtuv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141802-0tjtuv4","updated":"20250815141823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般项目出现卡顿、掉帧问题、图像问题、发热、掉电快等情况可以着重排查 GPU 和 CPU 使用情况，\n它们的异常表现几乎一致，根本原因通常是计算压力过大"}]},{"ID":"20250815141824-faqcevk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141824-faqcevk","updated":"20250815141854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 和 CPU 计算的区别在于："}]},{"ID":"20250815141849-aiqz00g","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141849-aiqz00g","updated":"20250815141852"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141849-9cq46wy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141849-9cq46wy","updated":"20250815141852"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141849-x4fan99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141849-x4fan99","updated":"20250815141852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 专注于 游戏逻辑 处理相关（物理、脚本、AI、动画控制等等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141850-dts9i0v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141850-dts9i0v","updated":"20250815141851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141850-imay8n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141850-imay8n0","updated":"20250815141851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 专注于 图形渲染 处理相关（Shader、模型绘制、光照、特效、后处理等等）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141837-y5jqzk5","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250815141837-y5jqzk5","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250815141839-7fqa9bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-7fqa9bm","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250815141839-3pbgbrh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-3pbgbrh","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141839-keejhxu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-keejhxu","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141839-cii5152","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-cii5152","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Usage 的数据收集 会影响性能表现"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141839-37h7o0s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-37h7o0s","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141839-l3aznff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-l3aznff","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会禁用 GPU Jobs（图形工作线程优化）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815141839-duxu21g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-duxu21g","updated":"20250815141839"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815141839-7hh9m3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815141839-7hh9m3j","updated":"20250815142138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并不支持显示详细的 URP 和 HDRP 相关数据（仅支持内建渲染管线）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-s9jhfq5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-s9jhfq5","updated":"20250815143932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于 GPU Usage 的注意事项"}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-2nwwfq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-2nwwfq8","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Usage 默认是关闭的，需要去顶部页签的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Profiler Modules（模块列表）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处勾选 GPU Usage 才可启用，详见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250808143332-zggv4qq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL2-1——顶部页签"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nGPU Usage 会有一个警告，提示大致意思为："}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-obri91c","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-obri91c","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20250815143928-wghj5lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-wghj5lm","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250815142402-279y2w0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-0r1fnda","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-0r1fnda","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250815143928-jj8lxeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-jj8lxeo","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采集 GPU Profiler 数据会禁用图形作业、增加性能开销，并降低 CPU 模块的准确性。如果你不需要这些数据，请关闭此模块。"}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-h6a99it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-h6a99it","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HDRP 和 URP 渲染器当前不受支持： 如果启用了这些渲染器，Profiler 将不会显示大多数 GPU 标记。（如果你的工程是 URP 或 HDRP 的）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-36zyyg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-36zyyg7","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-r3f3f8w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-r3f3f8w","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815143928-6jfu6zl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-6jfu6zl","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815143928-i1h25od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-i1h25od","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240326200621-dpqeb0v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Graphics Jobs"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是 Unity 用于加速渲染流程的多线程技术，开启 GPU Profiler 会关闭它，影响性能测试的真实性。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-ykxmg3w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-ykxmg3w","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815143928-6p2945q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-6p2945q","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在使用 URP（通用渲染管线）或 HDRP（高清渲染管线） 时，GPU 模块不会显示详细的 GPU 时间采样（比如各个 pass、shader 的耗时），所以数据不完整"}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-c9r1975","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-c9r1975","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250815143112-bqz5u5o.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"在 URP/HDRP 工程内，使用GPU Usage 无法显示除 Other 以外的时间消耗"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250815143928-wtd6351","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815143928-wtd6351","updated":"20250815143928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"建议：\n如果你只关心 CPU 性能或者使用 SRP（如 URP/HDRP），可以暂时关闭 GPU Profiler。除非你在测试传统内置渲染管线的 GPU 性能。\n对于 SRP（URP/HDRP）我们可以使用 Rendering Debugger 进行性能检测（以后再讲解 URP 先关知识时，("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","